{"case_id": "singapore_male_19930408_P004-Q20", "domain": "annual_fortune", "question": "命主抑郁症状最严重的年份？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字（癸酉、丙辰、己未、丙子），日主为己土，生于辰月，土旺得令，且有丙火生扶，身强。喜金水木，忌火土。\n\n抑郁症状通常与木（肝胆、情志）受克、水（肾、恐）受制或流年引发五行失衡有关。  \n- 2002年（壬午）：壬水正财，午火偏印，火土加重，但壬水透出，尚可流通，且年少，压力不大。  \n- 2016年（丙申）：丙火正印透干，申金伤官，但申子辰合水局，水旺生木，情绪有出口，不算最差。  \n- 2018年（戊戌）：戊土劫财，戌土比肩，火土极旺，克水（财星）严重，且戌未刑，土重埋金，木气全无，抑郁症状最易爆发。  \n- 2024年（甲辰）：甲木正官，辰土劫财，木土交战，但甲木透出，有制土之象，且辰为湿土，稍缓。\n\n综合判断，2018年土最旺，水木全伤，情绪压抑最重。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "temporal_route_state": "ROUTED_WITH_TARGETS", "time_context_sha256": null, "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_time_off", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "singapore_male_19930408_P004-Q20", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6d\\runs\\phase6-6d-v1-20260808-r1\\dev\\2025_b1a_time_off_r0_g0\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 4070, "response_id": "502e9752-176b-4d4b-bcce-840a5b4a69fe", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 208, "completion_tokens": 285, "total_tokens": 493, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 80}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
